    envelope, the Add/Delete/Update headers, `*** Move to:`, `@@` context lines, three lines of
    context, stacked `@@`, `*** End of File`, and the example patch.
  - src/patch/{parse,chunks}.rs: the patch format and the strategy of locating a hunk by trying
    exact, then trailing-whitespace-insensitive, then trim-both-sides comparison
