Reviewed, no text or code reused
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Cline, Roo Code, Aider, Goose (Apache-2.0): tool descriptions read for ideas (line-range
    reads, edit formats); nothing copied.
  - Zed (GPL-3.0-or-later) and Crush (FSL-1.1-MIT): reference only. The behaviours implemented
    here that those projects also have (whitespace-insensitive matching with re-indent, a
    read-before-edit ledger keyed on file state, multi-edit, a result note when a forgiving match
    was used) were written from scratch from the behaviour described in the research notes. None
    of their text or code is used.
